I think that astral vision is not handled correctly,  and there's
at least one bug connected with it.  I noticed with my
SLASH'EM monk that he can't see items or monsters that are
underwater, while I was looking for that magic lamp somewhere.
You'd think that if he can see through walls, he should be able
to see that shark or that kelp frond or the magic lamp especially.

Oh, and the bug (I sent it to the Devteam, but got no reply):
When you have just found a trap and there's an item lying on it,
you won't be shown where it is exactly, because astral vision
will make you see everything around you even at the moment
when only the square with the trap should be visible.



